OL,3,AChina state broadcaster pulls La Liga
OL,4,Amatches following Mbappe joke
OL,5,
OL,6,FChina's state broadcaster CCTV did not
OL,7,Fair a Real Madrid match on Sunday,
OL,8,Fdespite the club's star striker Kylian
OL,9,FMbappe's apology for his "ill-judged"
OL,10,Fremarks on the late Chinese leader Mao
OL,11,FZedong.
OL,13,FMbappe drew huge backlash after saying
OL,14,Fthe meme "that makes [him] laugh the
OL,15,Fmost" was the one in which his face is
OL,16,Fsuperimposed on a "Chinese dictator"
OL,17,Fresembling Mao.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
