OL,3,AChina state broadcaster pulls La Liga
OL,4,Amatches following Mbappe joke
OL,5,
OL,6,FChina Media Group, CCTV's parent
OL,7,Forganisation, said last Tuesday it
OL,8,Fwould suspend broadcasts of Spanish
OL,9,Ffootball La Liga matches following the
OL,10,Ffurore, which also led to Mbappe being
OL,11,Fdropped by several Chinese brands.
OL,13,FChina's foreign ministry had said it
OL,14,Ftook Mbappe's apology "seriously". Real
OL,15,FMadrid and La Liga have also
OL,16,Fapologised.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
